   'Caprese Salad. Italian dish, 10 minutes. Ingredients: tomatoes, mozzarella, basil, olive oil, balsamic vinegar. Slice the tomatoes and mozzarella and arrange them overlapping with basil leaves. Drizzle with olive oil and balsamic, then season with salt and pepper.'),
  ('Migas', 'Tex-Mex', 20, 2, ARRAY['eggs', 'tortillas', 'onion', 'bell peppers', 'cheddar cheese', 'salsa'],
   'Cut the tortillas into strips and fry until crisp. Add diced onion and pepper and cook until soft. Pour in the beaten eggs and scramble, then finish with cheddar and salsa.',
   false, true, true, false, false, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Migas. Tex-Mex dish, 20 minutes. Ingredients: eggs, tortillas, onion, bell peppers, cheddar cheese, salsa. Cut the tortillas into strips and fry until crisp. Add diced onion and pepper and cook until soft. Pour in the beaten eggs and scramble, then finish with cheddar and salsa.'),
  ('Pesto Pasta with Peas', 'Italian', 15, 2, ARRAY['pasta', 'basil pesto', 'frozen peas', 'parmesan'],
   'Cook the pasta, adding the peas for the last 2 minutes. Drain, keeping a little water, then toss with pesto, a splash of the water and grated parmesan.',
   true, true, true, false, false, false, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Pesto Pasta with Peas. Italian dish, 15 minutes. Ingredients: pasta, basil pesto, frozen peas, parmesan. Cook the pasta, adding the peas for the last 2 minutes. Drain, keeping a little water, then toss with pesto, a splash of the water and grated parmesan.'),
  ('Crispy Chickpea Salad', 'Mediterranean', 20, 2, ARRAY['canned chickpeas', 'cherry tomatoes', 'cucumber', 'red onion', 'lemon', 'olive oil', 'feta'],
   'Pat the chickpeas dry and fry in olive oil until crisp. Toss with halved tomatoes, cucumber, thinly sliced red onion, lemon juice and crumbled feta.',
   true, true, true, true, false, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Crispy Chickpea Salad. Mediterranean dish, 20 minutes. Ingredients: canned chickpeas, cherry tomatoes, cucumber, red onion, lemon, olive oil, feta. Pat the chickpeas dry and fry in olive oil until crisp. Toss with halved tomatoes, cucumber, thinly sliced red onion, lemon juice and crumbled feta.'),
  ('Dal Tadka', 'Indian', 35, 4, ARRAY['toor dal (arhar)', 'onion', 'tomatoes', 'garlic', 'ghee', 'cumin seeds (jeera)', 'turmeric (haldi)', 'red chili powder (lal mirch)', 'asafoetida (hing)', 'cilantro (hara dhania)'],
   'Rinse the dal and pressure-cook it with turmeric, salt and 3 cups of water for 3 to 4 whistles, or simmer for 30 minutes, until soft. Whisk it smooth. For the tadka, heat the ghee, crackle the cumin seeds and add a pinch of hing. Add sliced garlic and chopped onion and fry until golden, then the tomatoes and chili powder until soft. Pour the tadka over the dal, simmer 5 minutes and finish with cilantro.',
   true, true, true, false, false, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Dal Tadka. Indian dish, 35 minutes. Ingredients: toor dal (arhar), onion, tomatoes, garlic, ghee, cumin seeds (jeera), turmeric (haldi), red chili powder (lal mirch), asafoetida (hing), cilantro (hara dhania). Rinse the dal and pressure-cook it with turmeric, salt and 3 cups of water for 3 to 4 whistles, or simmer for 30 minutes, until soft. Whisk it smooth. For the tadka, heat the ghee, crackle the cumin seeds and add a pinch of hing. Add sliced garlic and chopped onion and fry until golden, then the tomatoes and chili powder until soft. Pour the tadka over the dal, simmer 5 minutes and finish with cilantro.'),
  ('Tomato Moong Dal', 'Indian', 25, 3, ARRAY['moong dal', 'tomatoes', 'ghee', 'cumin seeds (jeera)', 'turmeric (haldi)', 'asafoetida (hing)', 'green chilies (hari mirch)', 'cilantro (hara dhania)', 'lemon'],
   'Rinse the moong dal and simmer it with turmeric, salt and 3 cups of water for about 20 minutes, until soft. Heat the ghee, crackle the cumin seeds and add the hing, slit green chilies and chopped tomatoes. Cook until the tomatoes break down. Stir this into the dal and simmer 3 minutes. Finish with lemon juice and cilantro.',
   true, true, true, false, false, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Tomato Moong Dal. Indian dish, 25 minutes. Ingredients: moong dal, tomatoes, ghee, cumin seeds (jeera), turmeric (haldi), asafoetida (hing), green chilies (hari mirch), cilantro (hara dhania), lemon. Rinse the moong dal and simmer it with turmeric, salt and 3 cups of water for about 20 minutes, until soft. Heat the ghee, crackle the cumin seeds and add the hing, slit green chilies and chopped tomatoes. Cook until the tomatoes break down. Stir this into the dal and simmer 3 minutes. Finish with lemon juice and cilantro.'),
  ('Jeera Rice', 'Indian', 30, 3, ARRAY['basmati rice', 'ghee', 'cumin seeds (jeera)', 'bay leaf (tej patta)', 'salt'],
   'Rinse the rice until the water runs clear and soak it for 15 minutes. Heat the ghee, crackle the cumin seeds with the bay leaf, then add the drained rice and stir gently for a minute. Add 1¾ cups of water per cup of rice and some salt. Cover and cook on low for 12 minutes. Rest 5 minutes and fluff with a fork.',
   true, true, true, true, false, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Jeera Rice. Indian dish, 30 minutes. Ingredients: basmati rice, ghee, cumin seeds (jeera), bay leaf (tej patta), salt. Rinse the rice until the water runs clear and soak it for 15 minutes. Heat the ghee, crackle the cumin seeds with the bay leaf, then add the drained rice and stir gently for a minute. Add 1¾ cups of water per cup of rice and some salt. Cover and cook on low for 12 minutes. Rest 5 minutes and fluff with a fork.'),
  ('Chana Masala', 'Indian', 35, 4, ARRAY['canned chickpeas (chole)', 'onion', 'tomatoes', 'ginger (adrak)', 'garlic', 'green chilies (hari mirch)', 'cumin seeds (jeera)', 'coriander powder (dhania)', 'turmeric (haldi)', 'garam masala', 'cilantro (hara dhania)'],
   'Crackle the cumin seeds in hot oil, then fry the chopped onion until deep golden. Add grated ginger, garlic and green chilies for a minute. Add the tomatoes, turmeric, coriander powder and salt and cook until the oil separates. Add the drained chickpeas and a cup of water, mash a few against the pan and simmer 15 minutes. Stir in the garam masala and top with cilantro.',
   true, true, true, true, true, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Chana Masala. Indian dish, 35 minutes. Ingredients: canned chickpeas (chole), onion, tomatoes, ginger (adrak), garlic, green chilies (hari mirch), cumin seeds (jeera), coriander powder (dhania), turmeric (haldi), garam masala, cilantro (hara dhania). Crackle the cumin seeds in hot oil, then fry the chopped onion until deep golden. Add grated ginger, garlic and green chilies for a minute. Add the tomatoes, turmeric, coriander powder and salt and cook until the oil separates. Add the drained chickpeas and a cup of water, mash a few against the pan and simmer 15 minutes. Stir in the garam masala and top with cilantro.'),
  ('Palak Paneer', 'Indian', 35, 3, ARRAY['spinach (palak)', 'paneer', 'onion', 'tomatoes', 'ginger (adrak)', 'garlic', 'green chilies (hari mirch)', 'cumin seeds (jeera)', 'garam masala', 'fresh cream'],
   'Blanch the spinach for 2 minutes, cool it in cold water and blend it with the green chilies until smooth. Crackle the cumin seeds in oil, then fry the onion until golden. Add ginger, garlic and tomatoes and cook until soft. Stir in the spinach puree, garam masala and salt and simmer 5 minutes. Add cubed paneer and a spoon of cream and heat through.',
   true, true, true, true, false, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Palak Paneer. Indian dish, 35 minutes. Ingredients: spinach (palak), paneer, onion, tomatoes, ginger (adrak), garlic, green chilies (hari mirch), cumin seeds (jeera), garam masala, fresh cream. Blanch the spinach for 2 minutes, cool it in cold water and blend it with the green chilies until smooth. Crackle the cumin seeds in oil, then fry the onion until golden. Add ginger, garlic and tomatoes and cook until soft. Stir in the spinach puree, garam masala and salt and simmer 5 minutes. Add cubed paneer and a spoon of cream and heat through.'),
  ('Aloo Gobi', 'Indian', 30, 4, ARRAY['potatoes (aloo)', 'cauliflower (gobi)', 'onion', 'tomatoes', 'ginger (adrak)', 'green chilies (hari mirch)', 'cumin seeds (jeera)', 'turmeric (haldi)', 'coriander powder (dhania)', 'garam masala', 'cilantro (hara dhania)'],
   'Crackle the cumin seeds in oil and fry the onion until soft. Add ginger, green chilies, turmeric and coriander powder, then the cubed potatoes and cauliflower florets with salt. Toss to coat, cover and cook on low for 15 minutes, stirring now and then. Add the chopped tomatoes and cook uncovered until the vegetables are tender. Finish with garam masala and cilantro.',
   true, true, true, true, true, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Aloo Gobi. Indian dish, 30 minutes. Ingredients: potatoes (aloo), cauliflower (gobi), onion, tomatoes, ginger (adrak), green chilies (hari mirch), cumin seeds (jeera), turmeric (haldi), coriander powder (dhania), garam masala, cilantro (hara dhania). Crackle the cumin seeds in oil and fry the onion until soft. Add ginger, green chilies, turmeric and coriander powder, then the cubed potatoes and cauliflower florets with salt. Toss to coat, cover and cook on low for 15 minutes, stirring now and then. Add the chopped tomatoes and cook uncovered until the vegetables are tender. Finish with garam masala and cilantro.'),
  ('Kanda Poha', 'Indian', 20, 2, ARRAY['poha', 'onion', 'potato (aloo)', 'peanuts', 'mustard seeds (rai)', 'curry leaves (kadi patta)', 'green chilies (hari mirch)', 'turmeric (haldi)', 'lemon', 'cilantro (hara dhania)', 'sugar'],
   'Rinse the poha in a strainer and let it soften for 5 minutes. Fry the peanuts in oil until crisp and set them aside. In the same oil, crackle the mustard seeds with curry leaves and green chilies. Add the onion and diced potato and cook covered until the potato is tender. Add turmeric, the poha, salt and a pinch of sugar, toss gently and steam 2 minutes. Finish with the peanuts, lemon juice and cilantro.',
   true, true, true, true, true, false, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Kanda Poha. Indian dish, 20 minutes. Ingredients: poha, onion, potato (aloo), peanuts, mustard seeds (rai), curry leaves (kadi patta), green chilies (hari mirch), turmeric (haldi), lemon, cilantro (hara dhania), sugar. Rinse the poha in a strainer and let it soften for 5 minutes. Fry the peanuts in oil until crisp and set them aside. In the same oil, crackle the mustard seeds with curry leaves and green chilies. Add the onion and diced potato and cook covered until the potato is tender. Add turmeric, the poha, salt and a pinch of sugar, toss gently and steam 2 minutes. Finish with the peanuts, lemon juice and cilantro.'),
  ('Rava Upma', 'Indian', 20, 2, ARRAY['semolina (rava)', 'onion', 'mustard seeds (rai)', 'urad dal', 'curry leaves (kadi patta)', 'ginger (adrak)', 'green chilies (hari mirch)', 'ghee', 'cilantro (hara dhania)'],
   'Dry-roast the semolina until it smells nutty, then set it aside. Heat the ghee and crackle the mustard seeds and urad dal until golden. Add curry leaves, ginger, green chilies and onion and cook until soft. Pour in 2½ cups of water with salt and bring to a boil. Stream in the semolina while stirring, cover and cook on low for 3 minutes. Finish with cilantro.',
   true, true, true, false, false, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Rava Upma. Indian dish, 20 minutes. Ingredients: semolina (rava), onion, mustard seeds (rai), urad dal, curry leaves (kadi patta), ginger (adrak), green chilies (hari mirch), ghee, cilantro (hara dhania). Dry-roast the semolina until it smells nutty, then set it aside. Heat the ghee and crackle the mustard seeds and urad dal until golden. Add curry leaves, ginger, green chilies and onion and cook until soft. Pour in 2½ cups of water with salt and bring to a boil. Stream in the semolina while stirring, cover and cook on low for 3 minutes. Finish with cilantro.'),
  ('Rajma Chawal', 'Indian', 45, 4, ARRAY['canned kidney beans (rajma)', 'onion', 'tomatoes', 'ginger (adrak)', 'garlic', 'cumin seeds (jeera)', 'coriander powder (dhania)', 'red chili powder (lal mirch)', 'garam masala', 'basmati rice'],
   'Start the rice. Crackle the cumin seeds in oil and fry the onion until deep golden. Add ginger and garlic, then the tomatoes, coriander powder, chili powder and salt, and cook into a thick masala. Add the drained kidney beans and 2 cups of water and simmer 20 minutes, mashing a few beans to thicken the gravy. Stir in the garam masala and serve over the rice.',
   true, true, true, true, true, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Rajma Chawal. Indian dish, 45 minutes. Ingredients: canned kidney beans (rajma), onion, tomatoes, ginger (adrak), garlic, cumin seeds (jeera), coriander powder (dhania), red chili powder (lal mirch), garam masala, basmati rice. Start the rice. Crackle the cumin seeds in oil and fry the onion until deep golden. Add ginger and garlic, then the tomatoes, coriander powder, chili powder and salt, and cook into a thick masala. Add the drained kidney beans and 2 cups of water and simmer 20 minutes, mashing a few beans to thicken the gravy. Stir in the garam masala and serve over the rice.'),
  ('Masala Omelette', 'Indian', 10, 1, ARRAY['eggs', 'onion', 'tomatoes', 'green chilies (hari mirch)', 'cilantro (hara dhania)', 'turmeric (haldi)'],
   'Beat the eggs with a pinch of turmeric and salt. Stir in finely chopped onion, tomato, green chili and cilantro. Heat a little oil in a pan, pour in the eggs and cook on medium until the bottom is set. Fold or flip and cook 30 seconds more.',
   false, true, true, true, true, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Masala Omelette. Indian dish, 10 minutes. Ingredients: eggs, onion, tomatoes, green chilies (hari mirch), cilantro (hara dhania), turmeric (haldi). Beat the eggs with a pinch of turmeric and salt. Stir in finely chopped onion, tomato, green chili and cilantro. Heat a little oil in a pan, pour in the eggs and cook on medium until the bottom is set. Fold or flip and cook 30 seconds more.'),
  ('Anda Curry', 'Indian', 30, 3, ARRAY['eggs', 'onion', 'tomatoes', 'ginger (adrak)', 'garlic', 'turmeric (haldi)', 'red chili powder (lal mirch)', 'coriander powder (dhania)', 'garam masala', 'cilantro (hara dhania)'],
   'Hard-boil the eggs for 10 minutes, peel them and make a few shallow slits. Fry the onion until golden, then add ginger and garlic. Add the tomatoes, turmeric, chili powder, coriander powder and salt and cook until thick. Add a cup of water and the eggs and simmer 8 minutes. Finish with garam masala and cilantro.',
   false, true, true, true, true, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Anda Curry. Indian dish, 30 minutes. Ingredients: eggs, onion, tomatoes, ginger (adrak), garlic, turmeric (haldi), red chili powder (lal mirch), coriander powder (dhania), garam masala, cilantro (hara dhania). Hard-boil the eggs for 10 minutes, peel them and make a few shallow slits. Fry the onion until golden, then add ginger and garlic. Add the tomatoes, turmeric, chili powder, coriander powder and salt and cook until thick. Add a cup of water and the eggs and simmer 8 minutes. Finish with garam masala and cilantro.'),
  ('Homestyle Chicken Curry', 'Indian', 50, 4, ARRAY['chicken thighs', 'onion', 'tomatoes', 'ginger (adrak)', 'garlic', 'yogurt (dahi)', 'turmeric (haldi)', 'red chili powder (lal mirch)', 'coriander powder (dhania)', 'garam masala', 'cilantro (hara dhania)'],
   'Mix the chicken with yogurt, turmeric, chili powder and salt and set aside for 15 minutes. Fry the onion until deep golden, then add ginger and garlic. Add the tomatoes and coriander powder and cook until the oil separates. Add the chicken and cook on high for 5 minutes, then add a cup of water, cover and simmer 20 minutes until cooked through. Finish with garam masala and cilantro.',
   false, false, true, true, false, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Homestyle Chicken Curry. Indian dish, 50 minutes. Ingredients: chicken thighs, onion, tomatoes, ginger (adrak), garlic, yogurt (dahi), turmeric (haldi), red chili powder (lal mirch), coriander powder (dhania), garam masala, cilantro (hara dhania). Mix the chicken with yogurt, turmeric, chili powder and salt and set aside for 15 minutes. Fry the onion until deep golden, then add ginger and garlic. Add the tomatoes and coriander powder and cook until the oil separates. Add the chicken and cook on high for 5 minutes, then add a cup of water, cover and simmer 20 minutes until cooked through. Finish with garam masala and cilantro.'),
  ('Moong Dal Khichdi', 'Indian', 30, 3, ARRAY['moong dal', 'basmati rice', 'ghee', 'cumin seeds (jeera)', 'turmeric (haldi)', 'asafoetida (hing)', 'black pepper'],
   'Rinse the rice and moong dal together. Heat the ghee, crackle the cumin seeds and add the hing and a pinch of crushed black pepper. Add the rice and dal, turmeric, salt and 4 cups of water. Pressure-cook for 3 whistles, or simmer covered for 25 minutes, until soft and porridge-like. Serve with a spoon of ghee on top.',
   true, true, true, false, false, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Moong Dal Khichdi. Indian dish, 30 minutes. Ingredients: moong dal, basmati rice, ghee, cumin seeds (jeera), turmeric (haldi), asafoetida (hing), black pepper. Rinse the rice and moong dal together. Heat the ghee, crackle the cumin seeds and add the hing and a pinch of crushed black pepper. Add the rice and dal, turmeric, salt and 4 cups of water. Pressure-cook for 3 whistles, or simmer covered for 25 minutes, until soft and porridge-like. Serve with a spoon of ghee on top.'),
  ('Bhindi Masala', 'Indian', 25, 3, ARRAY['okra (bhindi)', 'onion', 'tomatoes', 'cumin seeds (jeera)', 'turmeric (haldi)', 'red chili powder (lal mirch)', 'coriander powder (dhania)', 'amchur'],
   'Wash and fully dry the okra, then cut it into pieces. Fry it in oil on medium-high, uncovered, until it''s no longer sticky, and set it aside. Crackle the cumin seeds, fry the onion, then add the tomatoes and spices with salt. Return the okra, toss for 3 minutes and finish with amchur.',
   true, true, true, true, true, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Bhindi Masala. Indian dish, 25 minutes. Ingredients: okra (bhindi), onion, tomatoes, cumin seeds (jeera), turmeric (haldi), red chili powder (lal mirch), coriander powder (dhania), amchur. Wash and fully dry the okra, then cut it into pieces. Fry it in oil on medium-high, uncovered, until it''s no longer sticky, and set it aside. Crackle the cumin seeds, fry the onion, then add the tomatoes and spices with salt. Return the okra, toss for 3 minutes and finish with amchur.'),
  ('Besan Chilla', 'Indian', 20, 2, ARRAY['besan (gram flour)', 'tomatoes', 'green chilies (hari mirch)', 'cilantro (hara dhania)', 'carom seeds (ajwain)', 'turmeric (haldi)'],
   'Whisk the besan with turmeric, ajwain, salt and enough water to make a pourable batter. Stir in finely chopped tomato, green chili and cilantro. Spread a ladle of batter thin on a hot oiled pan, cook until the edges lift, then flip and cook 1 minute more.',
   true, true, true, true, true, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Besan Chilla. Indian dish, 20 minutes. Ingredients: besan (gram flour), tomatoes, green chilies (hari mirch), cilantro (hara dhania), carom seeds (ajwain), turmeric (haldi). Whisk the besan with turmeric, ajwain, salt and enough water to make a pourable batter. Stir in finely chopped tomato, green chili and cilantro. Spread a ladle of batter thin on a hot oiled pan, cook until the edges lift, then flip and cook 1 minute more.'),
  ('Lemon Rice', 'Indian', 20, 3, ARRAY['cooked rice', 'lemon', 'peanuts', 'mustard seeds (rai)', 'chana dal', 'urad dal', 'curry leaves (kadi patta)', 'green chilies (hari mirch)', 'turmeric (haldi)', 'asafoetida (hing)'],
   'Heat oil and fry the peanuts until crisp. Add the mustard seeds, chana dal and urad dal and fry until the dals turn golden. Add curry leaves, green chilies, hing and turmeric. Turn off the heat, add the cooked rice, lemon juice and salt, and mix gently.',
   true, true, true, false, true, false, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Lemon Rice. Indian dish, 20 minutes. Ingredients: cooked rice, lemon, peanuts, mustard seeds (rai), chana dal, urad dal, curry leaves (kadi patta), green chilies (hari mirch), turmeric (haldi), asafoetida (hing). Heat oil and fry the peanuts until crisp. Add the mustard seeds, chana dal and urad dal and fry until the dals turn golden. Add curry leaves, green chilies, hing and turmeric. Turn off the heat, add the cooked rice, lemon juice and salt, and mix gently.'),
  ('Curd Rice', 'Indian', 15, 2, ARRAY['cooked rice', 'yogurt (dahi)', 'milk', 'mustard seeds (rai)', 'curry leaves (kadi patta)', 'ginger (adrak)', 'green chilies (hari mirch)'],
   'Mash the rice lightly while it''s warm, then mix in the yogurt, a splash of milk and salt. Heat a little oil, crackle the mustard seeds and add curry leaves, grated ginger and green chilies. Pour this tempering over the rice and mix. Serve cool.',
   true, true, true, true, false, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Curd Rice. Indian dish, 15 minutes. Ingredients: cooked rice, yogurt (dahi), milk, mustard seeds (rai), curry leaves (kadi patta), ginger (adrak), green chilies (hari mirch). Mash the rice lightly while it''s warm, then mix in the yogurt, a splash of milk and salt. Heat a little oil, crackle the mustard seeds and add curry leaves, grated ginger and green chilies. Pour this tempering over the rice and mix. Serve cool.'),
  ('Paneer Bhurji', 'Indian', 20, 2, ARRAY['paneer', 'onion', 'tomatoes', 'green chilies (hari mirch)', 'turmeric (haldi)', 'garam masala', 'butter', 'cilantro (hara dhania)'],
   'Melt the butter and fry the onion and green chilies until soft. Add the tomatoes, turmeric and salt and cook until mushy. Crumble in the paneer, add the garam masala and stir for 3 minutes. Finish with cilantro.',
   true, true, true, true, false, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Paneer Bhurji. Indian dish, 20 minutes. Ingredients: paneer, onion, tomatoes, green chilies (hari mirch), turmeric (haldi), garam masala, butter, cilantro (hara dhania). Melt the butter and fry the onion and green chilies until soft. Add the tomatoes, turmeric and salt and cook until mushy. Crumble in the paneer, add the garam masala and stir for 3 minutes. Finish with cilantro.'),
  ('Masala Chai', 'Indian', 10, 2, ARRAY['black tea (chai patti)', 'milk', 'ginger (adrak)', 'cardamom (elaichi)', 'sugar'],
   'Bring 1 cup of water to a boil with crushed ginger and cardamom. Add the tea and simmer 2 minutes. Add 1 cup of milk and sugar to taste, bring back to a boil and simmer 2 minutes more. Strain into cups.',
   true, true, true, true, false, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Masala Chai. Indian dish, 10 minutes. Ingredients: black tea (chai patti), milk, ginger (adrak), cardamom (elaichi), sugar. Bring 1 cup of water to a boil with crushed ginger and cardamom. Add the tea and simmer 2 minutes. Add 1 cup of milk and sugar to taste, bring back to a boil and simmer 2 minutes more. Strain into cups.'),
  ('Vegetable Pulao', 'Indian', 35, 4, ARRAY['basmati rice', 'frozen peas (matar)', 'carrots', 'green beans', 'onion', 'ghee', 'cumin seeds (jeera)', 'bay leaf (tej patta)', 'cloves (laung)', 'cardamom (elaichi)', 'cinnamon (dalchini)'],
   'Rinse and soak the rice for 15 minutes. Heat the ghee and fry the whole spices for 30 seconds, then the sliced onion until golden. Add the diced carrots, beans and peas and stir for 2 minutes. Add the drained rice, 1¾ cups of water per cup of rice and salt. Cover and cook on low for 12 minutes, then rest 5 minutes.',
   true, true, true, true, false, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Vegetable Pulao. Indian dish, 35 minutes. Ingredients: basmati rice, frozen peas (matar), carrots, green beans, onion, ghee, cumin seeds (jeera), bay leaf (tej patta), cloves (laung), cardamom (elaichi), cinnamon (dalchini). Rinse and soak the rice for 15 minutes. Heat the ghee and fry the whole spices for 30 seconds, then the sliced onion until golden. Add the diced carrots, beans and peas and stir for 2 minutes. Add the drained rice, 1¾ cups of water per cup of rice and salt. Cover and cook on low for 12 minutes, then rest 5 minutes.'),
  ('Tamatar Paneer', 'Indian', 25, 3, ARRAY['paneer', 'tomatoes', 'cumin seeds (jeera)', 'asafoetida (hing)', 'turmeric (haldi)', 'red chili powder (lal mirch)', 'garam masala', 'fresh cream'],
   'Blend the tomatoes into a puree. Crackle the cumin seeds in oil, add the hing, then the puree, turmeric, chili powder and salt. Cook until thick and the oil separates. Add cubed paneer, garam masala and a spoon of cream and simmer 3 minutes.',
   true, true, true, false, false, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Tamatar Paneer. Indian dish, 25 minutes. Ingredients: paneer, tomatoes, cumin seeds (jeera), asafoetida (hing), turmeric (haldi), red chili powder (lal mirch), garam masala, fresh cream. Blend the tomatoes into a puree. Crackle the cumin seeds in oil, add the hing, then the puree, turmeric, chili powder and salt. Cook until thick and the oil separates. Add cubed paneer, garam masala and a spoon of cream and simmer 3 minutes.'),
  ('Aloo Paratha', 'Indian', 40, 4, ARRAY['whole wheat flour (atta)', 'potatoes (aloo)', 'green chilies (hari mirch)', 'cilantro (hara dhania)', 'carom seeds (ajwain)', 'amchur', 'ghee'],
   'Knead the atta with water and a pinch of salt into a soft dough and rest it for 15 minutes. Boil and mash the potatoes, then mix in chopped green chilies, cilantro, ajwain, amchur and salt. Roll a ball of dough, fill it with the potato mix, seal and roll it out gently. Cook on a hot tawa, brushing with ghee, until golden spots appear on both sides.',
   true, true, true, false, false, true, 'starter', 'starter',
   'Aloo Paratha. Indian dish, 40 minutes. Ingredients: whole wheat flour (atta), potatoes (aloo), green chilies (hari mirch), cilantro (hara dhania), carom seeds (ajwain), amchur, ghee. Knead the atta with water and a pinch of salt into a soft dough and rest it for 15 minutes. Boil and mash the potatoes, then mix in chopped green chilies, cilantro, ajwain, amchur and salt. Roll a ball of dough, fill it with the potato mix, seal and roll it out gently. Cook on a hot tawa, brushing with ghee, until golden spots appear on both sides.'),
