   'Broken Wheat Vegetable Upma. Indian dish, 30 minutes. Ingredients: broken wheat (dalia), onion, carrots, green beans, peas (matar), mustard seeds (rai), curry leaves (kadi patta), green chilies (hari mirch). Roast the broken wheat in a dry pan until fragrant. Crackle mustard seeds and curry leaves, soften the onion and green chili, then add the vegetables. Add the wheat, 2½ cups of water and salt, cover and cook on low 15 minutes until tender.'),
